# Copy to `.env.local` (gitignored). It holds what the Convex CLI manages and never a secret:
# `pnpm dev` reads those from Infisical (README, Running the private tools).

# `pnpm convex-dev` fills this in and keeps it current, and adds `CONVEX_DEPLOYMENT` and
# `CONVEX_SITE_URL`. Leave it empty and add no bare `CONVEX_URL`: given two URL names the CLI
# updates neither. Production gets its URL at build time: see docs/deployment.md.
PUBLIC_CONVEX_URL=
